{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667900/extras/c6516d9a2d47f0a2a1854e01aed9f948.avif?t=1751786826\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get an early taste of our upcoming deck-builder tower defense game, Hand of Hexes. The demo features a limited selection of the cards, towers, biomes, and enemies that will be included in the final game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand of Hexes is a <strong>no-text deckbuilder</strong> and <strong>tower defense</strong> game where you control the enemies' paths by constructing deadly mazes \u2013 using towers with crazy attack patterns. Create a perfect deck of exotic towers and magical spells that boost your defenses or slay your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667900/extras/97577d99613c51c2e902693742bf8356.avif?t=1751786826\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667900/extras/03e70934520a2c4928df752290a16026.avif?t=1751786826\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667900/extras/6d0e6d2ae16282ccbe4eb8f4f59b3bbf.poster.avif?t=1751786826\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667900/extras/6d0e6d2ae16282ccbe4eb8f4f59b3bbf.webm?t=1751786826\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667900/extras/6d0e6d2ae16282ccbe4eb8f4f59b3bbf.mp4?t=1751786826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run is <strong>unique</strong> with different decks, encounters, and levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is <strong>no text and no descriptions - </strong>find out what each tower and spell does through trial and error</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your way across a variety of <strong>procedural maps</strong> - and do it again, but <strong>harder</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667900/extras/cb47239c2c410c259e7ee5764c656dfb.avif?t=1751786826\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667900/extras/e3d7145838fb110cd0d6b63e8f1298cf.poster.avif?t=1751786826\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667900/extras/e3d7145838fb110cd0d6b63e8f1298cf.webm?t=1751786826\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667900/extras/e3d7145838fb110cd0d6b63e8f1298cf.mp4?t=1751786826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Hand of Hexes towers have <strong>unique attack patterns</strong>: they might only shoot in one direction, circle projectiles or launch <strong>fierce bees</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Position your towers to guide the enemies through deadly mazes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buff your towers via <strong>spell cards</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667900?t=1751786826","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667900/10c817ff5a57d82ae21c968d7937e12cae8f9f04/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751786826","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667900/0931fef9782fe980356f195a068946ad5d1ef232/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17517868